ure the camaraderie and shared creative spirit. Utilize a 50mm lens for a slightly wider, more natural perspective. The color palette should be dominated by greens, blues, and earthy tones, with subtle pops of color from art supplies. --ar 16:9 --style raw --v 5 --creative"}, "class_type": "Text Multiline"}, "122": {"_meta": {"title": "Save Image"}, "inputs": {"images": ["77", 0], "filename_prefix": "sarah1a3/TEST: Park Art Meetup/base"}, "class_type": "SaveImage"}}, "variables": {"prompt": "A young professional woman, Sarah, early thirties, with a warm smile, showing her partially-filled sketchbook to another artist during a casual plein air sketching meetup in a sun-drenched Portland park. They are both sitting on weathered wooden benches, surrounded by 2-3 other artists engaged in their own creative work nearby. Diffused sunlight streams through the trees, creating a soft, ethereal glow. Sarah wears a flowy, olive green linen dress (long sleeves, slightly relaxed fit), layered with a brown corduroy jacket and a delicate gold pendant necklace. Beside her are a small watercolor palette and various art supplies. The background is blurred with bokeh, emphasizing vibrant green foliage and the distant city skyline. Capture the camaraderie and shared creative spirit. Utilize a 50mm lens for a slightly wider, more natural perspective. The color palette should be dominated by greens, blues, and earthy tones, with subtle pops of color from art supplies. --ar 16:9 --style raw --v 5 --creative"}, "output_folder": "gap_analysis/test_73/base-image"}	\N	Manually cleared - was blocking queue	0	2025-12-08 18:28:24.99326	\N	2025-12-08 18:28:24.952924	2025-12-08 18:28:24.996775	\N
